# Mutation plan for GET /api/v4/license/client (getClientLicense).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/license-client.plan
#
# Tab-separated: name<TAB>file<TAB>from<TAB>to<TAB>suite<TAB>filter.  `\n` becomes a newline.
#
# The decisions a reader could plausibly get wrong on this route are: which of the two 400s an
# empty `format` gets and in what order they are checked; whether the comparison is
# case-sensitive; whether the body carries a newline; and — the one with a wrong *answer* rather
# than a wrong error — whether a licensed installation is forwarded or served the unlicensed map.
#
# `api-first-query-value` mutates the shared `query_first` helper rather than this route's own
# code, because "first value of a repeated key" is `url.Values.Get` semantics that live there.
# The filter keeps the verdict this suite's.
#
# The last two lines are the no-op controls and must SURVIVE.

